## 九、项目阶段和人力规划

### Q22. 如果只有 3～4 个人做这个 MC，你建议第一版做到哪里就停？

我们目前考虑：

### M0 — DDR Init

- Reset
- CSR
- Init
- MR
- PHY/Training
- DFI

### M1 — Basic Read/Write

- ACT
- PRE
- RD
- WR
- Bank State
- Basic Timing

### M2 — Long-run Stability

- Refresh
- Complete timing constraints
- Turnaround
- Long-run test

### M3 — SoC Interface

- AXI
- Burst
- WSTRB
- Basic ID
- Backpressure

### M4 — Bootloader

- DDR memory usable by CPU
- Bootloader can relocate / execute from DDR

### M5 — OS Boot

- Linux / target OS boots
- long-run stability

### M6 — Performance

- outstanding
- bank parallelism
- row hit
- reorder
- read/write batching

### M7 — DDR6 Advanced Features / SLT Features

- advanced DDR6 protocol
- CPGC
- raw command injection
- timing stress
- error injection
- trace / protocol monitor

请教：

> 这个里程碑拆法是否合理？

